==Description==
'''Love Letter''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Season of Love]] on any map. 

It was used to complete Ranks on the [[Season of Love#Season Pass|Season of Love Season Pass]]. Every time a rank was earned, the amount of '''Love Letters''' obtained were reset.

It took the appearance of an open envelope with a love letter inside.

